an</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Desai</surname><given-names>TA</given-names></name></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Microscale multilayer cocultures for biomimetic blood vessels.</article-title><source>J Biomed Mater Res A</source><volume>72</volume><fpage>146</fpage><lpage>160</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15558555</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001211-Xu1"><label>6</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Xu</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Jin</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Gregory</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Hickman</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Boland</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Inkjet printing of viable mammalian cells.</article-title><source>Biomaterials</source><volume>26</volume><fpage>93</fpage><lpage>99</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15193884</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001211-SakiyamaElbert1"><label>7</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sakiyama-Elbert</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name><name><surname>Hubbell</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name></person-group><year>2000</year><article-title>Controlled release of nerve growth factor from a heparin-containing fibrin-based cell ingrowth matrix.</article-title><source>J Control Release</source><volume>69</volume><fpage>149</fpage><lpage>158</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11018553</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001211-Thomas1"><label>8</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Thomas</surname><given-names>AC</given-names></name><name><surname>Campbell</surname><given-names>JH</given-names></name></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>Conjugation of an antib